  "reasoning": "The facts describe that the defendant Chen rented a space to run a clothing processing workshop, employed workers, and failed to pay their wages totaling 85,361 RMB. He was ordered by the labor bureau to pay by a specific deadline but did not comply, and only later partially paid part of the owed wages, leaving a remaining debt evidenced by an IOU. This conduct matches the statutory offense of refusing to pay labor remuneration (拒不支付劳动报酬罪). No other criminal conduct such as fraud, illegal occupation, or violent acts is indicated, so only this charge applies.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]拒不支付劳动报酬<eoa>"
}

